  "releaseNotes": "TinyEvents.SqlServer.AdoNet 1.0.0-beta.1\n\n      Added\n      - Bounded atomic cleanup of eligible processed messages.\n      - Migration 002_AddProcessedCleanupIndex for ordered cleanup lookups.\n\n      Hardened\n      - SQL Server processing, retries, lease recovery, cleanup, migrations, and rolling upgrades against a real database.\n      - Current migration history now rejects a missing outbox table instead of accepting inconsistent schema state.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Evidence-backed pre-1.0 beta with application-owned publishing transactions.\n      - Upgrade every TinyEvents package in the application to beta.1 together.",
